{"id":"644186","name":"土豆丝饼","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644186/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"大半个"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"1根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备简单的食材。","img":"images/644186/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆搓丝。","img":"images/644186/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"打入一个鸡蛋清，加鸡蛋清煎出来会有一点软，没有想象中的脆，下次可以试试不加的。","img":"images/644186/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"拧入黑胡椒海盐碎。","img":"images/644186/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"顺时针搅匀。","img":"images/644186/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"平底锅热油。","img":"images/644186/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"夹入土豆丝。","img":"images/644186/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"中间窝出一个洞。","img":"images/644186/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"打入鸡蛋黄。","img":"images/644186/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎熟以后翻面。","img":"images/644186/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"两面煎成焦黄，就可以出锅了。","img":"images/644186/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}